   "text": "INTO City University of London - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nINTO City University of London\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFor 125+ years, City, University of London has delivered academic excellence to students from all over the world. With links to more than 5,000 global companies and home to the triple-accredited Bayes Business School (formerly Cass), it’s the perfect place to build a thriving and sustainable career.Students will build a career development portfolio, focusing on three areas: personal development, career skills development, and industry and cultural experience. With this evidence of their employability skills, they’ll be in a strong position to compete for internships and placements when they start their degree.Located in London, the best city in the world for students (QS Best Student Cities 2022)World top 70 business school (QS World University Rankings by Subject 2021).A member institution of the University of London, one of the oldest and largest universities in the UK5,000+ business links with paid work placements for all undergraduate students\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 09:39\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:39\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £20,465.00\nMin: £12,295.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n25%\n5,052 of 20,210 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n1894\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/01/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAs accommodation is allocated on a first-come, first-served basis, students should confirm their place soon after receiving an offer to have the best chance of getting their preferred option.\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HFrrshcA6mA\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
